# Content discipline

- Follow prefixes in `Content/Aevum/README.md` (`BP_`, `WBP_`, `L_`, `DA_`, `IMC_`, etc.).
- Do **not** invent or check in placeholder `.uasset` / `.umap` binaries.
- Experimental work → `Content/Aevum/Developer/`.
- Assume Git LFS + lockable `.uasset`/`.umap` for real editor-authored assets.
- Keep multiplayer-safe: server validates grants; UI may predict.
- Maps should stay World Partition / OFPA-friendly when authored.
